rong=\"H3205\".   \n"},{"number":25,"text":"How is|strong=\"H5892\"the|strong=\"H5800\"city|strong=\"H5892\"of|strong=\"H5892\"praise|strong=\"H8416\"not|strong=\"H3808\"forsaken|strong=\"H5800\",  \nthe|strong=\"H5800\"city|strong=\"H5892\"of|strong=\"H5892\"my|strong=\"H5800\"joy|strong=\"H4885\"?   \n"},{"number":26,"text":"Therefore|strong=\"H3651\"her|strong=\"H3605\"young|strong=\"H3117\"men|strong=\"H3605\"will|strong=\"H3068\"fall|strong=\"H5307\"in|strong=\"H3068\"her|strong=\"H3605\"streets|strong=\"H7339\",  \nand|strong=\"H3068\"all|strong=\"H3605\"the|strong=\"H3605\"men|strong=\"H3605\"of|strong=\"H3068\"war|strong=\"H4421\"will|strong=\"H3068\"be|strong=\"H3068\"brought|strong=\"H3068\"to|strong=\"H3068\"silence|strong=\"H1826\"in|strong=\"H3068\"that|strong=\"H3605\"day|strong=\"H3117\",”  \nsays|strong=\"H5002\"the|strong=\"H3605\"LORD|strong=\"H3068\"of|strong=\"H3068\"Armies|strong=\"H6635\".   \n"},{"number":27,"text":"“I will|strong=\"H2346\"kindle|strong=\"H3341\"a|strong=\"H3068\"fire|strong=\"H3341\"in|strong=\"H2346\"the|strong=\"H3341\"wall|strong=\"H2346\"of|strong=\"H2346\"Damascus|strong=\"H1834\",  \nand|strong=\"H2346\"it|strong=\"H1130\"will|strong=\"H2346\"devour the|strong=\"H3341\"palaces of|strong=\"H2346\"Ben Hadad.”   \n"},{"number":28,"text":"Of|strong=\"H1121\"Kedar|strong=\"H6938\", and|strong=\"H1121\"of|strong=\"H1121\"the|strong=\"H5221\"kingdoms|strong=\"H4467\"of|strong=\"H1121\"Hazor|strong=\"H2674\", which|strong=\"H3068\"Nebuchadnezzar|strong=\"H5019\"king|strong=\"H4428\"of|strong=\"H1121\"Babylon struck|strong=\"H5221\", The|strong=\"H5221\"LORD|strong=\"H3068\"says|strong=\"H3541\":  \n“Arise|strong=\"H6965\", go|strong=\"H5927\"up|strong=\"H5927\"to|strong=\"H3068\"Kedar|strong=\"H6938\",  \nand|strong=\"H1121\"destroy|strong=\"H7703\"the|strong=\"H5221\"children|strong=\"H1121\"of|strong=\"H1121\"the|strong=\"H5221\"east|strong=\"H6924\".   \n"},{"number":29,"text":"They|strong=\"H1992\"will|strong=\"H6629\"take|